# Portfolio Frontend Environment Configuration Placeholders
# NOTE: Frontend environment variables are public and bundled into client code.
# Never store database credentials, private keys, or server secrets here.

# Example: If configuring Web3Forms, Formspree, or custom API endpoints in the future:
# VITE_CONTACT_FORM_ENDPOINT=https://api.web3forms.com/submit
# VITE_BACKEND_API_BASE_URL=https://api.sainath-jadhav.com
